{"id":"n4f3603d4d2","headline":"September rent increase rate set at 31.79 percent","summary":"With the release of August inflation data by TÜİK, the maximum rent increase for September has been set at 31.79 percent. The cap is based on the 12-month CPI average.","why":"Turkey's rent cap is tied to the official 12-month CPI average, which reflects the inflation trend that drives Turkish rate and currency decisions.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Ankara","country":"Turkey","lat":39.93,"lon":32.86,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Gazete Güncel","url":"https://www.gazeteguncel.com/eylul-ayi-kira-zam-orani-yuzde-3179-oldu-174098h.htm"},"sources":[{"name":"Gazete Güncel","url":"https://www.gazeteguncel.com/eylul-ayi-kira-zam-orani-yuzde-3179-oldu-174098h.htm"}],"published_at":"2026-09-03T08:01:43Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T10:44:44Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"fd78b6fd3c30a8fa","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T10:44:44Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-03T08:01:43Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-03T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"TU","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"Eylül ayı kira zam oranı yüzde 31,79 oldu","source_language":"tur","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/housing-construction-7237492.jpg","alt":"housing construction (illustration)","credit":"wal_172619","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/construction-site-workers-7237492/"}}